## GOD NODE AUDIT GATE

Before touching `MetaController` (5 edges):
□ Declare in task description: "touching MetaController (5 edges)"
□ Read `RetryPlan`, `FailBlock`, `_infer_category()` — all feed into it
□ Notify cross-agent: @cli-engineer if retry strategy affects output written to disk
□ Run full test suite after change
□ Update MEMORY_MAP.md god node entry if edge count changes

Before touching `files_in_diff()` (4 edges):
□ Declare in task description: "touching files_in_diff() (4 edges)"
□ Check all 4 rule functions — they all call `files_in_diff()` to get scope
□ Run full test suite after change

