## COMMON TASKS

| Task | Key files / functions |
|---|---|
| Add a new project-specific validator rule | add `_rule_*()` function + register in `main()` rules list |
| Fix false-positive in parity check | `_rule_mobile_desktop_parity()` — check mobile/desktop heuristics |
| Modify retry patch strategy for attempt-2 | `MetaController` — FULL AUDIT (5 edges) |
| Update `_load_project_rules()` for new rule format | tools/validator.py L110 |
| Fix `files_in_diff()` for edge-case diff format | tools/validator.py L27 — 4 edges, test all rule callers |
| Add a new `FailBlock` category for better error routing | `_infer_category()` + `FailBlock` class |

